WEBVTT

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:03.340
<i>Insect-Smashing Bug:</i>

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.480
<i>Crimson Piercing Round!</i>

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:08.270
<i>Die! Die! Die!</i>

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>I win.</i>

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:33.740
Insect Magistrate, I'll kill you!

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:37.310
<i>Earthquake Hammer!</i>

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:42.700
Matsunohara!

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.310
Insect Magistrate!

00:01:48.190 --> 00:01:50.180
What enormous power...

00:01:50.180 --> 00:01:52.210
He shattered a mountain!

00:01:53.690 --> 00:01:54.840
Tenma!

00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:59.840
Please escape on your own, Magistrate!

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:05.470
I will not.

00:02:09.150 --> 00:02:11.480
This time, it is my turn.

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:18.910
I will not escape alone...

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:24.260
Let's go, Tsukishima!

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:36.790
We shall return to Edo together,

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:38.770
Tsukishima.

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:41.990
Tsukishima!

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:48.480
<b>Jinbei's Power 
Awakens!!</b>

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:01.110
<i>Before long, they'll catch up.</i>

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:06.330
<i>I must hurry!</i>

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:17.460
<i>Please don't die!</i>

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:21.600
<i>I still have yet to apologize...</i>

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:26.120
Tsukishima!

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:26.970
Are you hurt?

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:31.560
Tsukishima?

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:44.740
<i>I am such a horrible woman 
for thinking you the enemy.</i>

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:50.500
<i>To protect me, you were 
prepared to sacrifice your life.</i>

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:55.250
<i>You did all you could for me.</i>

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:05.470
You must not die here!

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:08.420
You must live!

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:12.230
And I beg you...

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:14.730
Give me the chance to apologize!

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:17.760
<i>Armor Kick!</i>

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:23.670
What's wrong, Mugai?

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:26.160
You're starting to look worried.

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:29.660
Are you so concerned about 
the Insect Magistrate?

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.610
It's over!

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:39.090
We've neutralized Kuroageha's powers...

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:42.340
Now the Insect Magistrate is but a girl!

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:47.510
And by now, she's already dead.

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:50.630
I sent him to finish her.

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:07.660
That man...

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:08.780
Sougan..

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:12.370
He's more dedicated to the mission 
than any other Insect Hunter.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:20.100
Mashiro would kick and swear
 at her until she died.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:24.570
Shidou would stab her until she 
was just unmoving flesh.

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:29.890
However, he is different.

00:05:30.520 --> 00:05:34.360
I seek neither screams, 
pain, nor despair.

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:35.890
Nothing.

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:41.860
I merely seek your descent into hell.

00:05:49.970 --> 00:05:50.990
Farewell!

00:05:53.170 --> 00:05:54.960
<i>Am I going to die here?</i>

00:05:55.980 --> 00:06:01.810
<i>I still haven't apologized 
to Tsukishima...</i>

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:08.010
<i>Tsukishima...</i>

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:22.360
<i>Tsukishima?</i>

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:27.780
Child...

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:31.910
You...

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:38.520
<i>Tsukishima?</i>

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:39.540
<i>Is that you, Tsukishima?</i>

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:46.540
<i>He looks and feels like an 
utterly different person.</i>

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:51.500
<i>Above all, he's strong!</i>

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:56.180
<i>During the last fight, he was helpless.</i>

00:07:01.070 --> 00:07:04.190
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:10.700
It seems I must kill you first, child.

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:19.290
The more times I turn Purgatory's 
Spear, the greater its explosion.

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:22.210
And at maximum power,

00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:27.210
its explosion will blow off my arms.

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:35.430
But for our mission's sake, 
I will gladly use it on you.

00:07:36.590 --> 00:07:37.850
They're nearby.

00:07:38.280 --> 00:07:39.310
What?

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:40.730
They're nearby.

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:43.350
Many enemies.

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:46.400
<i>H-He's...</i>

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:50.610
<i>He isn't even thinking about me?</i>

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:53.780
<i>What is he?</i>

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:56.120
<i>And why?</i>

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:59.870
<i>Why can't I stop shaking?</i>

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:02.480
<i>This is too dangerous.</i>

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:04.880
<i>I must kill him here,</i>

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:07.750
<i>even if it costs my life.</i>

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:14.590
<i>Purgatory's Spear: Hellfire!</i>

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:37.070
I've failed...

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:44.830
<i>I see.</i>

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:47.260
Damn it! What happened?

00:08:48.890 --> 00:08:52.630
Mashiro! Shidou! Get down there and help.

00:08:53.450 --> 00:08:55.970
Don't let Sougan's death be in vain!

00:08:59.090 --> 00:09:00.070
Roger.

00:09:04.470 --> 00:09:07.600
Now, then...
 It's just the two of us.

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:09.750
Mugai,

00:09:10.390 --> 00:09:12.860
why did you betray the Insect Hunters?

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:16.910
That night, you went alone 
to kill the Magistrate.

00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:20.000
What happened?

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:26.360
When we were kids, 
we did everything together.

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:31.280
And everyone trusted you the most.

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:36.630
Much more than they trusted me...

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:44.750
So why did you join her?

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:47.390
You heard them say

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:51.650
that it was the Insect Magistrate 
 who destroyed our village.

00:09:52.910 --> 00:09:54.530
Tell me, my little brother...

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:57.660
Don't you dare call me "brother,"

00:09:58.240 --> 00:09:59.510
Insect Hunter!

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:04.410
Tsukishima?

00:10:07.860 --> 00:10:09.000
Tsukishima!

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:27.510
I'll just h-have to...

00:10:27.510 --> 00:10:29.190
<i>Multi-Slap!</i>

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:36.780
Die!

00:10:48.010 --> 00:10:49.980
What bad luck...

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:53.320
I can't believe the mudslide 
took me so far down.

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:56.750
Also...

00:10:58.560 --> 00:11:01.510
Do I really have to fight this guy?

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:04.510
What bad luck...

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:08.270
Kill everyone in my way!

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:15.600
Did we get him?

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:22.880
<i>Matsukichi! Tamekichi!</i>

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:25.600
I won't let you.

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:26.910
<i>Insect-Smashing Bug:</i>

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:28.640
<i>Crimson Piercing Round!</i>

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:41.180
Matsukichi! Tamekichi!

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:51.190
Then, I'll start with you.

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:56.820
Die...

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:06.370
Sorry I'm late.

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:09.580
Koikawa...

00:12:09.940 --> 00:12:11.620
The road here sucked.

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:19.840
Did you think you could win?

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:22.540
Let's kill them all.

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:25.630
I'll do it...

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:30.770
He's still alive?

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:33.310
That stupid kid's tough.

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:35.850
I am Kuroganemaru!

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:37.820
I'm not a stupid kid!

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:42.950
<i>Insect-Smashing Bug:</i>

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:46.250
<i>Crimson Piercing Round!</i>

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:49.750
Die! Die! Die! Die! Die!

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:52.420
Die! Die! Die!

00:12:58.190 --> 00:13:00.090
I win.

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:13.550
T-Tsukishima?

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:21.610
Tsukishima?

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:22.530
He's serious!

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:34.300
<i>Why?</i>

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:41.040
<i>Now Tsukishima seems more like
 me or the Insect Hunters...</i>

00:13:45.710 --> 00:13:51.180
<i>What happened to the Tsukishima 
who smiled at me?</i>

00:13:57.530 --> 00:13:58.940
Hey, Tsukishima!

00:14:01.310 --> 00:14:03.440
What are you doing?

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:06.450
Don't you know who we are?

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:14.450
Looks like he won't listen to us.

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:16.870
That guy's dangerous!

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:18.210
Yeah.

00:14:22.020 --> 00:14:23.870
He finally remembered us?

00:14:23.870 --> 00:14:25.840
No, look at his face...

00:14:26.960 --> 00:14:29.890
He's just more interested in 
them than he is in us.

00:14:34.650 --> 00:14:35.430
Fast!

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:36.520
Take this!

00:14:41.050 --> 00:14:42.210
He's gone...

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:47.650
Take this, stupid kid!

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:54.790
Don't let him humiliate us again, guys!

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:24.230
Tsukishima!

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:28.760
I can't breathe!

00:15:33.940 --> 00:15:37.000
What's happened to you, man?

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:12.280
<i>At this rate, Tsukishima 
will destroy himself...</i>

00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:14.530
<i>I have to stop him somehow!</i>

00:16:35.810 --> 00:16:38.490
Everyone is my enemy...

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:45.600
Enemies must be defeated!

00:16:49.740 --> 00:16:50.860
Run!

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:52.950
Tsukishima, you idiot!

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:00.120
Wh-What is this?

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:06.130
<i>I don't know what I can do now.</i>

00:17:07.850 --> 00:17:14.030
<i>But I don't want to see Tsukishima 
this way any longer!</i>

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:16.070
Yo...

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:30.610
You have such a pretty face.

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:32.680
Be happy.

00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:36.580
I'm going to rip it apart.

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:38.920
<i>Tsukishima!</i>

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:43.870
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:47.040
<i>I won't be able to keep my promise</i>

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:51.750
<i>to see the Edo skies with you!</i>

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:04.760
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:21.480
<i>Promise!</i>

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:44.480
M-Miss...

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:46.810
Are you okay?

00:18:52.390 --> 00:18:53.770
T-Tsukishima?

00:18:54.100 --> 00:18:56.500
Let's hurry to the Insect Magistrate!

00:18:58.350 --> 00:18:59.820
And also,

00:19:01.710 --> 00:19:02.920
keep our promise...

00:19:04.260 --> 00:19:05.510
Tsukishima?

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:29.440
We're withdrawing.

00:19:30.970 --> 00:19:33.940
The Magistrate is powerless 
and can be killed at our leisure.

00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:52.460
My hair?

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:03.170
<i>Does this have something to 
do with his transformation?</i>

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:06.100
Magistrate!

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:08.340
J-J-Jinbei-kun...

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:10.020
How disrespectful...

00:20:10.570 --> 00:20:14.270
After all that, you're napping on her lap?!

00:20:15.510 --> 00:20:17.150
Get off!

00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:19.410
What are you doing?

00:20:25.980 --> 00:20:28.910
I need to look into Jinbei-kun.

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:31.660
But for now...

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:38.800
The Insect Magistrate's Office, 
City Patrol, has completed its mission!

00:22:10.530 --> 00:22:14.730
Who is that young samurai?

00:22:15.970 --> 00:22:19.730
I've no interest in a dog serving 
one who disrespects our lord.

00:22:23.570 --> 00:22:24.650
Princess,

00:22:25.220 --> 00:22:28.160
the King will soon awaken.

00:22:28.590 --> 00:22:30.990
Wait just a little longer.

00:22:33.950 --> 00:22:37.790
When the awakening occurs, 
then I, Sanada Yukimura,

00:22:37.270 --> 00:22:41.500
<b>Sanada Yukimura</b>

00:22:38.410 --> 00:22:41.000
shall escort you to the castle.

00:22:41.770 --> 00:22:45.510
<b>Sarutobi Sasuke 
The Ten Crucifix Insects of Sanada</b>

00:22:46.190 --> 00:22:51.370
We return to the tower where 
our lord waits, Sasuke.

00:23:00.020 --> 00:23:02.560
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:00.520 --> 00:23:03.260
The softness, whiteness, roundness,

00:23:03.260 --> 00:23:05.170
their size and feel in your hands...

00:23:05.170 --> 00:23:06.570
I can't wait to taste them...

00:23:07.120 --> 00:23:08.980
The dumplings at Oharu-san's restaurant!

00:23:08.980 --> 00:23:10.200
O-Of course.

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:11.590
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:11.200 --> 00:23:14.000
<b>Training with Father! 
The Thirty-six Blades of Fuji!!</b>

00:23:11.590 --> 00:23:12.680
Training with Father.

00:23:12.680 --> 00:23:14.000
The Thirty-six Blades of Fuji.
